# App lockfiles are tracked for reproducible `npm ci`: the repo root,
# enterprise_server and enterprise_server/web are each standalone npm projects
# with their own lockfile. Bundled SKILLs are a separate subsystem and their
# lockfiles are intentionally not tracked.
